introduce</strong>, <strong>clarify</strong>, then <strong>challenge</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ Tile Types</strong>, <i>to be used to setup an <strong>orrb</strong> path</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3+ Areas</strong>, <i>each with their own unique challenge</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Time Pressure</strong>, <i>set everything up, check, double check, triple check perhaps?, before firing the orrb</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple Interface &amp; Interactions</strong>, <i>entirely playable with only mouse inputs (other inputs available)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"232\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822180/extras/bf7bbf03205e23ad52bad5c6c39812ec.poster.avif?t=1784970720\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822180/extras/bf7bbf03205e23ad52bad5c6c39812ec.webm?t=1784970720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1822180/extras/bf7bbf03205e23ad52bad5c6c39812ec.mp4?t=1784970720\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong><i>orrb</i></strong> is a solo indie project developed by myself (hi!). As a solo indie developer my goal is to explore ideas within the medium and I hope to continue creating small, high quality projects long into the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Constructive feedback of any kind is always welcome, so please don't hesitate to contact me, and I will do my best to respond to messages quickly and fix any problems that may arise. :)</p> </div>", "short_desc": "orrb is a tile based puzzle exploration game. where you explore levels, discover rules, place tiles, and when ready, send the orrb on its way.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.